'''Snowflakes''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is navy blue, which fades into a lilac color by the heel and guard. Imprinted on the blade are eight snowflakes varying in designs and sizes, hence the name. The handle is solid black.

